{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32057","headline":"送周判官元范赴越 · 贾岛","name":"送周判官元范赴越","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"原下相逢便别离，蝉鸣关路使回时。\n过淮渐有悬帆兴，到越应将坠叶期。\n城上秋山生菊早，驿西寒渡落潮迟。\n已曾几遍随旌斾，去谒荒郊大禹祠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32057.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32057","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}